              {
                "block_type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Recognize $e^{3t}u(-t)$ as the reflected signal $x(-t)$ for the base pair $x(t)=e^{-3t}u(t)$. Time reversal changes $X(j\\omega)$ to $X(-j\\omega)$ and nothing else.",
                "latex": "",
                "image_slot_id": ""
              },
