              {
                "block_type": "paragraph",
                "text": "$2e^{4t}u(-t)$ is just $x(-t)$ for the known pair $x(t)=2e^{-4t}u(t)$. Once that reflection is recognized, the frequency variable changes sign and the amplitude stays the same.",
